title: "fasthelper: the FastSuite runner and reporter"
abstract: "Runs a FastSuite chain from one TOML config with a full provenance manifest, aggregates every tool's reports across samples into one table and HTML report, compares raw vs processed runs, and owns the fastsuite.report.v1 schema."
